data_Si_SRM640g
# Silicon line-position standard, NIST SRM 640g.
# Certified lattice parameter a = 5.431109 A (22 degC), not a DFT-relaxed cell.
# Use this rather than a Materials Project entry when Si is the reference:
# MP cells are PBE-relaxed and run ~0.2% large, which drives a tan(theta)
# position drift that masquerades as a zero or displacement error.
#
# Si sits on 8a at (1/8,1/8,1/8), the origin-choice-2 setting used by CIF
# convention. Do not move it to (0,0,0): that is 8a only in origin choice 1,
# and under origin choice 2 it lands on 16c, which cancels every reflection
# except (111).
_cell_length_a                  5.431109
_cell_length_b                  5.431109
_cell_length_c                  5.431109
_cell_angle_alpha               90.0
_cell_angle_beta                90.0
_cell_angle_gamma               90.0
_cell_volume                    160.1718
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M  'F d -3 m'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number     227
_chemical_formula_sum           'Si'
_cell_formula_units_Z           8
_chemical_formula_structural    'Si'
